<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Hornbach cut at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hornbach cut at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>German retailer Hornbach Baumarket was cut to &quot;market outperformer&quot; from &quot;trading buy&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Thursday, following a sharp rise in its shares in the past month.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
